<title>SINGAPORE: Liang Huat Aluminium 1996 net plunges.</title>
<headline>Liang Huat Aluminium 1996 net plunges.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				0.42 vs   4.19</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)			  3.00 vs   6.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     0.19 vs   1.92</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)   0.48 vs   1.62</p>
<p>    Turnover				105.23 vs  79.35</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 1.74 vs   1.10</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    3.17 vs   0.91</p>
<p>    Depreciation &amp; amortisation	 3.18 vs   1.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  1.97 vs   6.05</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		  0.12 vs   0.02</p>
<p>    Tax					 1.60 vs   1.90</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (gain) 0.16 vs   0.06 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Liang Huat Aluminium Ltd makes aluminium window frames.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
